WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
«My contacts are burned.»

2
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.140
They're not burned.

3
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:08.000
You stopped knocking. A contact gets burned in one way only:

4
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.540
with the wrong message.

5
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.880
Look at the difference. The first:

6
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.520
«Hi! Do you want to hear about an opportunity?»

7
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:20.850
The second: «Marco, did you manage in the end to change those night shifts that were eating up your weekends with the kids?»

8
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.920
Only someone who remembers Marco can write the second one.

9
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.610
And after years of silence

10
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.910
RelAI reopens honestly:

11
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.970
«It's been a while. I remember you worked on a ship,

12
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.170
or am I wrong?» Nobody gets burned.

13
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.400
Nobody gets archived.
